hefermotor contains material ported from ponyc
(https://github.com/ponylang/ponyc), which is distributed under the
BSD 2-Clause licence reproduced below. The ported material is:

- the token kinds in hefermotor/parse/token_kind.pony, generated from
  the symbol and keyword tables in ponyc's src/libponyc/ast/lexer.c
  and carrying ponyc's token enumerator names;
- the lexer in hefermotor/parse/_lexer.pony and the string-literal
  escape decoding in hefermotor/parse/string_literal.pony, Pony
  rewrites of the lexing rules in src/libponyc/ast/lexer.c;
- the grammar in hefermotor/parse/_grammar.pony,
  _type_grammar.pony, _expr_grammar.pony, _expr_atom.pony and
  _expr_control.pony, a Pony rewrite, rule for rule, of the grammar
  in src/libponyc/ast/parser.c; and the top-level resynchronisation
  set in hefermotor/parse/_token_sets.pony, the union of ponyc's two
  RESTART sets.

